The legal text is the Libyan Civil Code and Law No. 6 of 2016, as published by the Ministry of Justice of Libya
(https://aladel.gov.ly), retrieved 29 October 2026. They are official legislation of the State of Libya. The Ministry's
site shows only a general "all rights reserved" footer and states no terms of reuse for its legal texts.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text layer of the Ministry's PDF was converted to Markdown, one file per article, one
paragraph or list item per line; Arabic presentation forms and a few look-alike letters were converted to standard
Arabic letters, wrapped lines were joined, page numbers and footnotes were left out, and the amendment of 2016 was
arranged as a git commit. The wording of the law was not changed. The Ministry of Justice does not endorse this
repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
